WEBVTT

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.200
I end my turn!

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.390
Savior?

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:41.490
Yusei Fudo, you gave the people
hope many times before.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:42.940
What do you mean?

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:51.930
Even in my future, your heroic tale was 
passed down from generation to generation.

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:55.130
My heroic tale?

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:07.340
What?

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:10.610
You're...

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:16.350
He's the same as Yusei?

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:20.120
Z-one, who are you?

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:26.980
Since you've seen my face, I should answer.

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:32.470
Yusei Fudo, I am your future self.

00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:33.240
What?

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:37.410
What?

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:42.600
In the future, humanity's yearning
for evolution was insatiable,

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:44.440
causing Moment to go out of control.

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:48.220
That was the beginning of everything.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:52.820
Moment is an engine that 
reads people's desires.

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:56.740
Evolution led to evil ideas, 
such as temptation and greed,

00:01:56.740 --> 00:02:00.700
taking over people's hearts, so 
Moment went out of control.

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:07.990
It infected the worldwide
 network with a certain idea.

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:12.450
That if nothing changes, the
world will be destroyed.

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:15.610
Humans are the cause,
so they must be eliminated.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.420
In order to save that world from destruction

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:25.750
and lead the people, you 
were resurrected in the future.

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:29.690
That is me.

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:35.200
You're...

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:38.160
My name is Yusei Fudo.

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:42.630
That's right!

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:49.030
The first time I met Z-one, I sensed 
that he was the same as Yusei.

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:51.980
Z-one is Yusei.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:57.150
Does that mean Yusei himself 
has come to destroy Neo Domino City?

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:58.140
No way!

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:02.810
You're saying that you're me?

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:05.660
That's impossible.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:09.130
What I said was the truth.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:14.780
So no matter what strategy you try, 
I already know it like the palm of my hand.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:18.100
Let's continue the duel.

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:24.570
Riding Duels.

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:27.720
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:34.260
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:42.330
Run! The road of evolution leading to tomorrow

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:46.870
Is a new legendary duel

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:03.830
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:09.450
Set free your infinite potential

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:15.060
Every beginning is up to you

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:21.670
Everyone is lost Pursue the light

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:26.970
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:32.540
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:40.390
Become the gale and dance Cut through the darkness

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:45.590
Even if you can't see your destination

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:51.060
Run on your feet without fear

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:56.930
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:04:56.930 --> 00:05:04.460
Going my way!! Break through and go!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:23.490
Resurrected Hero

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:25.380
My turn.

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:32.760
Lazion, the Timelord returns to 
my deck during my Standby Phase.

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:42.060
I send Nonexistence to my graveyard to activate
 the Continuous Trap Endless Emptiness.

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:49.610
Due to Endless Emptiness, I can Special Summon
 a Level 10-or-above monster from my hand.

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:54.780
But all my monsters
will have 0 attack points.

00:05:57.430 --> 00:06:00.250
I Special Summon Zaphion, the Timelord.

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:06.060
Zaphion, the Timelord can't be destroyed, 
and battle damage becomes 0.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:12.180
Will you be able to survive my Timelord's 
attack again this turn, Yusei Fudo?

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:18.840
When Timelord is on the field, its effect 
won't let you summon other monsters.

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:22.480
In other words, you can only 
 have one Timelord at a time.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:26.180
If you can only attack once per turn,
I can survive with Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:31.190
I told you that I know everything 
that you're thinking.

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:35.190
I already have a method to 
defeat that strategy.

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:40.040
Endless Emptiness has another effect.

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:44.590
When this card is faceup on my field,

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:48.420
its effect allows me
to summon more Timelords.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:53.380
So even if Timelord is on my 
field, I can summon other monsters.

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:54.310
What?

00:06:54.610 --> 00:07:00.350
Due to Endless Emptiness's 
effect, Timelords gain infinite power.

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:04.490
Due to Endless Emptiness's effect,

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:12.360
I Special Summon Sadion, the Timelord 
and Kamion, the Timelord from my hand.

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:20.840
Three Timelords?

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:24.640
Impossible! He had three
Timelords in his hand?

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:28.960
Yusei's strategy depends on 
there being only one Timelord!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:30.680
If there are three...

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:36.090
Sadion and Kamion can't be destroyed,
and battle damage becomes 0.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:37.690
Battle.

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:41.260
Zaphion, the Timelord attacks 
Black-Winged Dragon.

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:49.810
When Zaphion, the Timelord battles,

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:53.900
all your spell and trap cards on 
your field return to the deck.

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:55.230
This is bad!

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:58.380
If this succeeds, Scrap-Iron 
Scarecrow returns to his deck!

00:07:58.380 --> 00:07:59.110
Oh, no!

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:02.240
I flip over my trap card
Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:06.200
It negates your monster's attack!

00:08:07.360 --> 00:08:09.750
After it activates, 
it can be set again!

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:12.840
He stopped the first
effect activation.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:15.150
But there are still two Timelords.

00:08:15.150 --> 00:08:18.730
He can't activate Scrap-Iron 
Scarecrow again this turn!

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.220
Battle.

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:23.430
Sadion, the Timelord attacks 
Black Rose Dragon.

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:33.160
When Sadion, the Timelord battles,

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:37.610
if I have less than 4000 life points, 
 my life points become 4000.

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:42.200
Unbelievable!

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.650
Z-one's life points have 
been instantly restored!

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:47.550
It's back to the beginning!

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:49.080
No way!

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:51.530
After Yusei worked so hard 
to deal damage...

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:56.230
Kamion, the Timelord attacks
 Red Dragon Archfiend.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:06.560
When Kamion, the Timelord battles,

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:09.290
all your monsters return to your deck,

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:13.550
and you take 500 points
of damage for each one.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:14.750
What?

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.760
Three Synchro Monsters
are gone in an instant!

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:28.890
Yusei!

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:45.440
Yusei Fudo managed to
get control of his vehicle!

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:47.310
But Yusei's field is empty!

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:48.650
And he has zero cards in his hand!

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:51.280
How will he escape this terrible pinch?

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:55.490
Overcome this obstacle, Yusei!

00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:59.440
You narrowly escaped death.

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:00.460
I end my turn.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:03.800
But I managed to get to my next turn.

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:04.430
Now...

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:09.900
Yusei, I know you're searching 
for hope in this situation.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.140
I have zero cards in my hand.

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:18.610
If my next turn comes, the three 
Timelords return to my deck.

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:23.100
And if I don't draw
 any other Timelords,

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:27.220
I will have to end my turn 
without summoning a Timelord.

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:32.440
If that happens, you'll be able to 
attack and possibly win.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:33.280
This guy...

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:38.150
In the past, I also believed it was
possible to save the world.

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:42.680
But in the end, it didn't 
happen as I imagined.

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:47.150
This is how I arrived at
this conclusion.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:52.580
In order for peace in the future, this 
city must be destroyed now.

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:54.040
You're wrong!

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:56.590
No matter what, I won't give up!

00:10:56.590 --> 00:11:00.120
I  do not believe in saving 
the future by destroying the city!

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:02.050
You are not me!

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:04.520
You still deny it?

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:10.410
Then I will tell you the 
real reason why I'm you.

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:11.900
What?

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:21.610
I was a scientist who 
was looking for a way

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:25.440
to save the world from destruction.

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:31.390
I realized that in order 
to stop the machine army,

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:35.120
its power source was Moment.
And what powers Moment?

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:41.020
Yusei Particles read people's souls, so I  
must make people behave morally.

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:46.210
But the desires and negative 
feelings of arrogant people

00:11:46.210 --> 00:11:49.930
were things that I couldn't 
change with my own hands.

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:08.920
That's when I remembered Yusei 
Fudo, the savior of Neo Domino City.

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:14.910
He was the legendary hero who 
faced all obstacles and never gave up.

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:25.060
I decided that in order to save the 
world, I must become Yusei Fudo.

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:30.900
By copying his personality and joining it 
 with mine, I could become Yusei Fudo.

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:34.220
I could become the invincible hero.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:10.330
I was reborn as Yusei Fudo.

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:15.580
The one who would lead the  
people to behave morally.

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:18.570
Unbelievable.

00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:21.080
Z-one turned himself into Yusei?

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:27.190
He even rebuilt his own body 
 in order to save the future world.

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:31.660
Yusei Fudo, your power is incredible.

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:38.040
Everyone, listen!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:40.100
This world is heading
 towards destruction!

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:45.210
Humanity evolved rapidly, so we were
overtaken by greed and negativity.

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:49.080
That has caused Moment to run 
out of control in the negative direction.

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:51.500
What?
No way!

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:56.750
Everyone, watch!

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:05.630
Clear Mind!

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:07.830
Arise!

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:10.630
Shooting Star Dragon!

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:35.560
This is Clear Mind,
when your heart doesn't waver.

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:41.530
If we have good hearts and rid ourselves of 
greed, Moment won't be out of control anymore!

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:44.540
If that happens, the world 
will definitely be saved!

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:47.510
Everyone, come with me!

00:14:54.660 --> 00:15:00.470
Acting as you, I tried to spread
the power that I acquired.

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:09.350
Eventually, my people once again 
remembered to help each other,

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:14.460
understand each other, and the 
machine army stopped attacking us.

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:23.270
I began to feel that 
the world would be saved.

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:25.020
However...

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:31.750
There wasn't enough time left to spread 
the message to everyone.

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:40.380
Due to people's negativity, Moment finally
started to spin negatively towards destruction.

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:44.710
The affected network selected 
the path of destruction.

00:15:58.570 --> 00:16:01.310
Save me, Yusei!

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:02.730
Everyone!

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:11.470
Everyone!

00:16:21.700 --> 00:16:25.030
In the end, I wasn't able 
to save a single person.

00:16:26.160 --> 00:16:29.560
It wasn't possible to change people's hearts.

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:35.290
And I reached my current conclusion.

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:39.830
In order to save the world, 
I must erase the Moment

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:43.910
that your father created and
 Neo Domino City from history.

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:56.290
That's why he's trying 
 to destroy this city.

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:57.890
That's nonsense!

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.860
There will be many casualties!

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:03.790
Will that truly save the world?

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:07.970
You're fine as long as the people
of your future are saved?

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:11.500
You're fine if this city's 
people die in their place?

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:15.130
There's no way that's good!

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:19.780
I will find a way to save everyone 
in both the present and the future!

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:22.490
You still don't understand.

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:23.450
What?

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:27.920
Even though you showed up in the 
future, the future couldn't be saved.

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:33.400
Even though I had Yusei Fudo's power, I 
couldn't change the future from destruction!

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:39.370
The only path that remains 
is to sacrifice this city.

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:42.400
Yusei, continue the duel!

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:44.730
My turn!

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:50.780
I won't give up on the future!

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:53.750
I set one card and end my turn!

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:55.670
My turn.

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:03.320
Sadion, Zaphion and Kamion return
 to my deck during my Standby Phase.

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:07.800
Good! The Timelords 
have vanished from the field!

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:11.670
If Z-one doesn't draw a 
Timelord, I can see victory!

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:15.610
Zaphion, the Timelord's effect activates.

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:21.230
When it leaves the field, I can draw 
 until I have five cards in my hand.

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:23.900
I have one card in my hand.

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:26.900
Therefore, I draw four cards from my deck.

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:29.690
No way...

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:32.120
He has an effect
to replenish his hand.

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:36.430
I told you it wouldn't go as you planned.

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:41.930
With this draw, I added a 
new Timelord to my hand.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:45.460
I expected you to draw!

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:48.130
I flip over my trap card
Talisman of Reversal!

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:53.070
When you add cards to your hand
 other than during the Draw Phase,

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:56.300
I can draw until the number of 
cards in my hand matches yours!

00:18:58.340 --> 00:19:00.750
I believe this draw will
lead me to a comeback!

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:03.580
I draw five cards from my deck!

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:07.550
It's here.

00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:12.640
I can Special Summon this card when an  
effect adds it from my deck to my hand.

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:16.030
I Special Summon Scouting Warrior 
in defense position!

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:24.430
I Special Summon the Tuner Monster 
Steam Synchron from my hand!

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:30.980
I can Special Summon it from my hand when a 
monster is Special Summoned to my field!

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:38.620
When Steam Synchron is on my field, I can 
Synchro Summon even during your turn!

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:49.330
Level 3 Steam Synchron tunes 
Level 4 Scouting Warrior!

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:53.050
Luca, your mark!

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:56.070
Please protect Yusei!

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:58.040
The sacred lights of protection...

00:19:58.530 --> 00:20:01.640
Combine into eternal life!

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:03.010
Synchro Summon!

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:07.110
Descend, Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:11.500
It's here!

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:14.420
The strongest guardian, Ancient Fairy Dragon!

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:18.690
What an incredible feat to start 
from having zero cards in his hand

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:21.270
to Synchro Summoning during 
the opponent's turn!

00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:27.500
Do you think that cheap 
trick will work against me?

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:28.530
What?

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:33.220
I activate the trap card 
Empress's Crown from my hand.

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:40.640
I can activate it from my hand
when you summon a Synchro Monster.

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:47.080
I draw two cards for each 
 of your Synchro Monsters.

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:53.290
By summoning a Synchro Monster, 
you worsened your own situation.

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:57.120
I will erase everything you can do.

00:20:57.120 --> 00:20:59.930
Due to the Continuous Trap
Endless Emptiness's effect,

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:03.820
I Special Summon a Level 10-or-above 
monster from my hand.

00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:09.910
Witness the infinite power of the Timelords.

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:10.870
What?

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:13.700
Appear, Michion, the Timelord.

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:16.700
Hailon, the Timelord.

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:20.050
Raphion, the Timelord.

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:23.520
Gabrion, the Timelord.

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:28.140
And Sandaion, the Timelord.

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:34.490
No way!

00:21:34.490 --> 00:21:36.760
He instantly summoned five Timelords?

00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:40.470
No matter what you do, 
you can't save this city.

00:21:40.800 --> 00:21:44.570
Yusei Fudo, that's what 
you will learn.

00:22:06.230 --> 00:22:11.360
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:16.740
If we shed the same tears, let's laugh together

00:22:16.740 --> 00:22:22.110
Freed reality forms phrases in the piercing beat

00:22:22.110 --> 00:22:24.900
Our hearts resonate

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:30.080
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:36.710
We'll find a place for us

00:22:38.560 --> 00:22:43.800
Waking in a dream Stretch our hands toward the future

00:22:43.800 --> 00:22:48.850
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:55.030
Repaint the darkness with the colors we envision

00:22:55.030 --> 00:23:03.310
Overlaying memories, bonds and hope creates future color

00:23:03.310 --> 00:23:09.220
We will draw it forever
